  "description": "Watercolor Animal Print Wrapping Paper – 10 Seamless Patterns by Snapybiz\nBring a wild and trendy touch to your projects with this watercolor animal print digital paper collection. Inspired by safari and jungle wildlife, this set brings together classic animal skin prints in a coordinated palette of warm brown, tan, soft blush, neutral taupe, black and white, with a golden spotted design.\nYou will find blush leopard print rosettes, black and white zebra stripes, a soft blush zebra print, bold tiger stripes on tan, neutral and brown cow prints, and watercolor deer and antelope style spotted patterns. These seamless animal prints work beautifully as digital backgrounds and printable papers for many creative projects.\nWHAT YOU WILL RECEIVE\n• 10 PNG Digital Paper designs\n• 12×12 Inches – 3600 x 3600 Pixels\n• High Resolution 300 DPI\n• Seamless Repeating Patterns\n• Instant Download\nDESIGNS INCLUDE\n• Blush leopard print pattern\n• Black and white zebra print pattern\n• Soft blush zebra print pattern\n• Tiger stripe pattern in tan and black\n• Neutral taupe cow print pattern\n• Dark brown cow print pattern\n• Brown watercolor deer print with cream spots\n• Golden tan antelope style spotted pattern\nPERFECT FOR\n• Digital scrapbooking and printable paper projects\n• Junk journals and card making\n• Invitation backgrounds\n• Planner backgrounds and notebook covers\n• Printable wrapping paper designs\n• Fabric designs for home decor and fashion inspired projects\n• Wallpaper backgrounds and sublimation backgrounds\n• Safari nursery, safari baby shower and wild one birthday projects\nThese animal print patterns are easy to use in your favourite design software and print beautifully for paper crafts, fabric designs and digital projects.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Watercolor Animal Print Wrapping Paper – 10 Seamless Patterns by Snapybiz</p>\n<p>Bring a wild and trendy touch to your projects with this watercolor animal print digital paper collection. Inspired by safari and jungle wildlife, this set brings together classic animal skin prints in a coordinated palette of warm brown, tan, soft blush, neutral taupe, black and white, with a golden spotted design.</p>\n<p>You will find blush leopard print rosettes, black and white zebra stripes, a soft blush zebra print, bold tiger stripes on tan, neutral and brown cow prints, and watercolor deer and antelope style spotted patterns. These seamless animal prints work beautifully as digital backgrounds and printable papers for many creative projects.</p>\n<p>WHAT YOU WILL RECEIVE<br>\n• 10 PNG Digital Paper designs<br>\n• 12×12 Inches – 3600 x 3600 Pixels<br>\n• High Resolution 300 DPI<br>\n• Seamless Repeating Patterns<br>\n• Instant Download</p>\n<p>DESIGNS INCLUDE<br>\n• Blush leopard print pattern<br>\n• Black and white zebra print pattern<br>\n• Soft blush zebra print pattern<br>\n• Tiger stripe pattern in tan and black<br>\n• Neutral taupe cow print pattern<br>\n• Dark brown cow print pattern<br>\n• Brown watercolor deer print with cream spots<br>\n• Golden tan antelope style spotted pattern</p>\n<p>PERFECT FOR<br>\n• Digital scrapbooking and printable paper projects<br>\n• Junk journals and card making<br>\n• Invitation backgrounds<br>\n• Planner backgrounds and notebook covers<br>\n• Printable wrapping paper designs<br>\n• Fabric designs for home decor and fashion inspired projects<br>\n• Wallpaper backgrounds and sublimation backgrounds<br>\n• Safari nursery, safari baby shower and wild one birthday projects</p>\n<p>These animal print patterns are easy to use in your favourite design software and print beautifully for paper crafts, fabric designs and digital projects.</p>",
